---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - FinCalc Pro"
  description="Terms of service for using FinCalc Pro's financial calculators and website."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Terms of Service', url: '' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-prose mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-6">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      Please read these Terms of Service ("Terms") carefully before using the FinCalc Pro website
      and services. By accessing or using our website, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      By using FinCalc Pro, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not
      use our website. We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time without
      prior notice. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Description of Service</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      FinCalc Pro provides free, online financial calculators for educational and informational
      purposes. Our tools cover mortgages, loans, investments, retirement planning, salary and tax
      estimation, general finance, and real estate analysis. All calculators run entirely
      client-side in your browser. We do not provide any paid services, subscriptions, or
      premium features.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Disclaimer — Not Financial Advice</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The calculators and content on FinCalc Pro are provided for <strong>informational and
      educational purposes only</strong>. They are not intended to be, and should not be construed
      as, financial, tax, legal, or investment advice. Results are estimates based on the
      information you provide and standard financial formulas. Always consult a qualified
      professional for advice specific to your situation. See our full
      <a href="/disclaimer/" class="text-primary hover:underline"> Disclaimer</a> for more details.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      All content on FinCalc Pro, including text, graphics, logos, calculator logic, and software,
      is the property of FinCalc Pro unless otherwise noted. You may not reproduce, distribute,
      modify, or create derivative works from our content without prior written permission.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">User Conduct</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">You agree not to:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1 text-muted-foreground">
      <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose or in violation of applicable laws.</li>
      <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or harm our servers or infrastructure.</li>
      <li>Scrape, crawl, or use automated means to access the site without our express permission.</li>
      <li>Misrepresent the accuracy of calculator results or claim them as professional advice.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      FinCalc Pro and its operators shall not be liable for any damages arising from the use or
      inability to use our website or calculators. This includes, without limitation, direct,
      indirect, incidental, consequential, and punitive damages. The calculators are provided
      "as is" without warranty of any kind, either express or implied.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">External Links</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the
      content, privacy practices, or terms of those sites. Visiting external links from our site
      is at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately
      upon posting. Your continued use of the site after any modifications indicates your acceptance
      of the updated Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at:
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <a href="mailto:contact@fincalcpro.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">
        contact@fincalcpro.com
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
